OL,3,GNEWSAVictims bear the brunt of 'awful'
OL,4,Acourt delays
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I never imagined it would be this bad.
OL,7,FIt's just unbelievable," said Georgia,
OL,8,Ffrom West Sussex, who was sexually
OL,9,Fassaulted in Hampshire and experienced
OL,10,F"multiple" delays and postponements
OL,11,Fafter her abuser's case came to court
OL,12,Fthis year.
OL,14,F"No one cared. That's what it felt
OL,15,Flike," she said, describing the "awful"
OL,16,Femotional toll the process had on her.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
