OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVictims bear the brunt of 'awful'
OL,4,Acourt delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeorgia is one of hundreds of thousands
OL,7,Fof victims, witnesses and defendants
OL,8,Fsuffering the consequences of record
OL,9,Fcourt delays, which the Law Society
OL,10,Fsaid exposes a "deepening crisis" in
OL,11,Fthe criminal justice system.
OL,13,FThe government acknowledged that
OL,14,Fvictims are "waiting far too long for
OL,15,Fjustice" and said reducing the court
OL,16,Fbacklog is "a priority".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
